> **Status: design phase.** There is no compiler yet. The current work is the design itself and the benchmark that every design decision will be measured against. AI agents build the language as well. 1.0 is expected around {{fc.plan.rel_10_p50_month}} (median estimate; with {{pct80}}% probability by {{fc.plan.rel_10_p80_month}}) with one subscription from each of three AI companies. Both dates come from one seed of the schedule simulation; over {{fc.n_seeds}} seeds the median moves between {{fc.planning.rel_10_p50.earliest_month}} and {{fc.planning.rel_10_p50.latest_month}} and the {{pct80}}% date between {{fc.planning.rel_10_p80.earliest_month}} and {{fc.planning.rel_10_p80.latest_month}}. For the time being the work uses one Claude account shared with the owner's other work; if it stayed that way to the end, the median would move to between {{fc.claude_shared.rel_10_p50.earliest_month}} and {{fc.claude_shared.rel_10_p50.latest_month}}, and the {{pct80}}% date would lie beyond {{fc.last_month}}, where the schedule simulation stops. What one account gives in a week is an assumption that has not been measured yet.
